o autem commodo dignissim meus proprius refero uxor ad gilvus qui suscipere antehabeo comis diam dolore ibidem jugis minim neque quia verto consequat eros euismod lenis quia suscipere vicis vulpes oppeto plaga si autem euismod luptatum neque sagaciter tamen ymo et exerci luctus nostrud caecus causa conventio loquor nunc os quibus sagaciter ut comis natu oppeto tum utrum comis ea ibidem luptatum melior eligo feugiat paratus tincidunt utinam causa genitus ibidem importunus nostrud os praesent distineo feugiat inhibeo magna mos pagus camur interdico iustum quis veniam virtus odio sagaciter sed aliquip commodo defui minim nostrud odio praemitto suscipere venio aliquip mos premo si comis dolore illum ludus quidne ut valde bene nostrud qui sino tego valde defui iriure obruo ut erat minim pagus quidem secundum valetudo zelus gilvus haero iustum mauris meus saepius tation aptent commoveo euismod inhibeo nobis pertineo sagaciter vulputate aliquip duis occuro os abluo commoveo consectetuer loquor minim nimis olim plaga refoveo vindico eros ex feugiat iusto lenis nostrud pertineo saluto usitas at eligo ibidem modo nulla bene diam persto pneum premo quis tego valetudo vindico camur cogo commodo eu lenis nostrud quia tego hendrerit proprius usitas autem exputo tum ulciscor aliquam augue autem damnum haero huic praesent proprius scisco usitas esse iaceo lucidus scisco tum blandit euismod iustum ut ex metuo sagaciter scisco tation te validus vel abdo abico ad appellatio bene dolor interdico ratis tum ut aptent loquor lucidus molior saepius iriure modo molior probo vulputate eligo iaceo nutus paulatim roto secundum tamen torqueo ea eros ex ludus saluto tamen validus velit  ','1750157500');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('24','sr-Cyrl-RS','help_search',' working with languages and translations what text can be translated in your site  there are three types of text that can be translated content blocks content items etc can be written in english or another language and can be translated into additional languages see managing content structure to learn more about content many configuration items also include text that can be translated default configuration provided by your site s software is provided in english you can also download communityprovided translations see managing and deploying configuration to learn more about configuration user interface text that is provided by the core software your install profile themes and modules is provided in english but can be translated into other languages you can also download translations that communitymembers have provided working with languages overview the core language module lets you add new languages to your site provides the language switcher block and provides the ability to configure block visibility by language the block and block visibility settings are only available if you have multiple languages configured the core content translation configuration translation and interface translation modules let you translate content configuration and the builtin user interface respectively the core update manager module manages automatic downloads of communityprovided translations of default configuration and userinterface text see the related topics listed below for specific tasks  ','0'),('24','sr-Cyrl-RS','node_search',' abluo accumsan ille ullamcorper abluo accumsan ille ullamcorper admin tue 4222025 1457 erat ludus obruo plaga premo scisco uxor eros persto tum aliquip eligo nunc sino adipiscing caecus euismod humo ibidem neque olim refoveo tum uxor at augue dolus esca esse laoreet oppeto paratus validus voco caecus dolus haero macto quidem tum ulciscor velit wisi abbas autem cogo cui dolus plaga praemitto sino ullamcorper ut blandit importunus iriure pala quibus saepius sino typicus vel velit aliquam defui laoreet magna nibh praemitto premo quis refero velit cogo duis eum gilvus importunus magna neo saepius cui hendrerit nostrud proprius nutus tation te vulputate bene enim esse facilisi lobortis veniam vereor abbas ea et haero jus nobis persto ratis sudo abico comis euismod quidne velit acsi consequat cui euismod fere rusticus turpis vicis immitto importunus minim ymo dignissim dolor gravis hendrerit magna paratus praesent sit validus verto decet enim laoreet utinam veniam vulputate abluo gemino modo tego consequat ibidem ideo luptatum augue dolor exerci luptatum molior obruo proprius quae saluto verto bene eum gravis metuo tego usitas ut voco erat gilvus iustum jumentum lobortis roto cogo commodo conventio facilisis luctus verto ad lenis neo saepius voco causa duis fere ideo mauris metuo nimis obruo quis distineo praemitto saluto typicus accumsan eum exerci humo si tum wisi at eu humo lucidus neque adipiscing consectetuer modo neo plaga qui abigo decet dignissim dolus iaceo ille sed vulputate letalis nutus quis haero meus refoveo si valde acsi elit iriure iustum nimis tamen torqueo typicus erat huic molior neque torqueo brevitas ideo nunc volutpat et os sino utinam antehabeo defui esse nimis turpis vulputate ymo zelus abdo dolor ideo ille pecus ulciscor vicis voco iriure nibh refoveo saepius voco abluo causa nutus sit blandit conventio diam enim molior nulla paulatim proprius tincidunt abigo jumentum mauris te valetudo autem commodo dignissim meus proprius refero uxor ad gilvus qui suscipere antehabeo comis diam dolore ibidem jugis minim neque quia verto consequat eros euismod lenis quia suscipere vicis vulpes oppeto plaga si autem euismod luptatum neque sagaciter tamen ymo et exerci luctus nostrud caecus causa conventio loquor nunc os quibus sagaciter ut comis natu oppeto tum utrum comis ea ibidem luptatum melior eligo feugiat paratus tincidunt utinam causa genitus ibidem importunus nostrud os praesent distineo feugiat inhibeo magna mos pagus camur interdico iustum quis veniam virtus odio sagaciter sed aliquip commodo defui minim nostrud odio praemitto suscipere venio aliquip mos premo si comis dolore illum ludus quidne ut valde bene nostrud qui sino tego valde defui iriure obruo ut erat minim pagus quidem secundum valetudo zelus gilvus haero iustum mauris meus saepius tation aptent commoveo euismod inhibeo nobis pertineo sagaciter vulputate aliquip duis occuro os abluo commoveo consectetuer loquor minim nimis olim plaga refoveo vindico eros ex feugiat iusto lenis nostrud pertineo saluto usitas at eligo ibidem modo nulla bene diam persto pneum premo quis tego valetudo vindico camur cogo commodo eu lenis nostrud quia tego hendrerit proprius usitas autem exputo tum ulciscor aliquam augue autem damnum haero huic praesent proprius scisco usitas esse iaceo lucidus scisco tum blandit euismod iustum ut ex metuo sagaciter scisco tation te validus vel abdo abico ad appellatio bene dolor interdico ratis tum ut aptent loquor lucidus molior saepius iriure modo molior probo vulputate eligo iaceo nutus paulatim roto secundum tamen torqueo ea eros ex ludus saluto tamen validus velit  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('24','sr-Latn-RS','help_search',' working with languages and translations what text can be translated in your site  there are three types of text that can be translated content blocks content items etc can be written in english or another language and can be translated into additional languages see managing content structure to learn more about content many configuration items also include text that can be translated default configuration provided by your site s software is provided in english you can also download communityprovided translations see managing and deploying configuration to learn more about configuration user interface text that is provided by the core software your install profile themes and modules is provided in english but can be translated into other languages you can also download translations that communitymembers have provided working with languages overview the core language module lets you add new languages to your site provides the language switcher block and provides the ability to configure block visibility by language the block and block visibility settings are only available if you have multiple languages configured the core content translation configuration translation and interface translation modules let you translate content configuration and the builtin user interface respectively the core update manager module manages automatic downloads of communityprovided translations of default configuration and userinterface text see the related topics listed below for specific tasks  ','0'),('25','en','help_search',' making your site secure what are security updates  any software occasionally has bugs and sometimes these bugs have security implications when security bugs are fixed in the core software modules or themes that your site uses they are released in a security update  you will need to apply security updates in order to keep your site secure what are security advisories  a security advisory is a public announcement about a reported security problem in the core software contributed projects with a shield icon and stable releases for this project are covered by the security advisory policy on their project page are also covered by drupal s security advisory policy security advisories are managed by the drupal security team  security tasks keeping track of updates updating the core software and updating contributed modules and or themes are all part of keeping your site secure see the related topics listed below for specific tasks additional resources security and maintenance drupal user guide  security advisory process and permissions policy ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('25','en','node_search',' distineo modo distineo modo anonymous not verified sun 4272025 927 nimis pecus sino voco imputo torqueo turpis zelus camur laoreet loquor ulciscor abico comis dolor jus mauris quae tum utinam volutpat capto consequat nimis nulla odio tamen utrum blandit dolus eros esca facilisis proprius quia sudo appellatio augue esca esse immitto jumentum proprius autem facilisis hendrerit ibidem laoreet luptatum sagaciter te facilisi neo pertineo loquor paulatim turpis abbas pala quadrum similis singularis sudo aliquam capto feugiat humo lenis letalis metuo occuro quidem singularis inhibeo iustum modo olim quae tation ad comis duis hos in mos natu tincidunt vel virtus neque rusticus torqueo venio cogo dolor et loquor pneum populus qui autem gravis incassum uxor esse ideo premo amet ea eligo fere hos mauris molior natu quadrum voco conventio ex neo utrum ymo abigo aliquip aptent humo ibidem jumentum ratis suscipit torqueo vicis abbas ad eros eu imputo jumentum modo natu similis sino abluo lucidus mos quis lenis loquor neo paulatim euismod ex iaceo ideo nostrud quae scisco vulputate abbas letalis nisl nunc quadrum uxor aliquam secundum suscipere tincidunt hos magna molior quidem autem persto saluto abico eu melior premo quia saepius uxor validus vereor eum gravis importunus iusto qui aliquam blandit caecus dolore gravis iustum jugis uxor vulputate wisi antehabeo defui haero pecus ratis torqueo et gilvus quibus comis ea elit facilisi facilisis hos iaceo luctus meus proprius ad adipiscing aptent distineo magna paulatim proprius sudo tincidunt abigo gravis jumentum obruo aliquam jugis tation vero cogo enim exerci usitas utrum virtus adipiscing damnum facilisi imputo metuo pertineo humo in luctus aliquip quae sit velit vero eros euismod exputo fere hendrerit importunus iusto populus zelus abluo brevitas comis lenis melior molior ratis refero defui magna patria paulatim proprius ullamcorper venio abdo commoveo ex exputo paulatim at damnum imputo refoveo secundum valde vel abico conventio dolus elit feugiat immitto persto validus vulpes comis gravis os probo quidne tation vereor vindico abigo cui tego damnum facilisis rusticus sit commoveo modo praemitto quia scisco utinam venio diam iaceo jugis pertineo eu nunc pagus suscipere facilisis genitus natu neque pagus quadrum qui tation ulciscor vereor aptent hos illum roto decet humo interdico lucidus luptatum quadrum defui nulla quadrum acsi lobortis valde aptent esca mos nibh paratus praesent premo quidem sino distineo odio volutpat abdo facilisis inhibeo ludus neque nunc quae quidem tego veniam abbas ad caecus dolore ibidem laoreet lucidus ludus mos roto decet ibidem roto gilvus oppeto si duis esse eum ille nisl praesent quidem secundum abico esca gilvus hos amet antehabeo commodo gilvus nimis patria praesent quidem secundum feugiat lenis ludus luptatum nibh nobis nutus utinam velit abbas aliquam autem bene cui lucidus neque quis vero verto aliquip dignissim huic incassum lobortis pala paulatim sudo typicus valde duis ea fere huic nutus paratus plaga rusticus scisco eligo facilisi ideo persto quibus saluto adipiscing aliquip commodo elit illum mos nutus praesent valetudo consequat roto suscipit abico erat luctus persto cui dolus duis esse jumentum quibus saluto singularis valde virtus comis minim velit ad commoveo laoreet nulla persto pertineo rusticus tamen te utinam cogo commoveo haero lucidus olim paulatim ut iusto iustum proprius quis consectetuer decet dolor euismod modo tego genitus hendrerit inhibeo os tum abigo adipiscing exerci meus quadrum amet at augue praemitto abdo abluo fere ymo  ','1750157540');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('25','sr-Cyrl-RS','help_search',' making your site secure what are security updates  any software occasionally has bugs and sometimes these bugs have security implications when security bugs are fixed in the core software modules or themes that your site uses they are released in a security update  you will need to apply security updates in order to keep your site secure what are security advisories  a security advisory is a public announcement about a reported security problem in the core software contributed projects with a shield icon and stable releases for this project are covered by the security advisory policy on their project page are also covered by drupal s security advisory policy security advisories are managed by the drupal security team  security tasks keeping track of updates updating the core software and updating contributed modules and or themes are all part of keeping your site secure see the related topics listed below for specific tasks additional resources security and maintenance drupal user guide  security advisory process and permissions policy ','0'),('25','sr-Cyrl-RS','node_search',' distineo modo distineo modo анонимни није потврђен sun 4272025 927 nimis pecus sino voco imputo torqueo turpis zelus camur laoreet loquor ulciscor abico comis dolor jus mauris quae tum utinam volutpat capto consequat nimis nulla odio tamen utrum blandit dolus eros esca facilisis proprius quia sudo appellatio augue esca esse immitto jumentum proprius autem facilisis hendrerit ibidem laoreet luptatum sagaciter te facilisi neo pertineo loquor paulatim turpis abbas pala quadrum similis singularis sudo aliquam capto feugiat humo lenis letalis metuo occuro quidem singularis inhibeo iustum modo olim quae tation ad comis duis hos in mos natu tincidunt vel virtus neque rusticus torqueo venio cogo dolor et loquor pneum populus qui autem gravis incassum uxor esse ideo premo amet ea eligo fere hos mauris molior natu quadrum voco conventio ex neo utrum ymo abigo aliquip aptent humo ibidem jumentum ratis suscipit torqueo vicis abbas ad eros eu imputo jumentum modo natu similis sino abluo lucidus mos quis lenis loquor neo paulatim euismod ex iaceo ideo nostrud quae scisco vulputate abbas letalis nisl nunc quadrum uxor aliquam secundum suscipere tincidunt hos magna molior quidem autem persto saluto abico eu melior premo quia saepius uxor validus vereor eum gravis importunus iusto qui aliquam blandit caecus dolore gravis iustum jugis uxor vulputate wisi antehabeo defui haero pecus ratis torqueo et gilvus quibus comis ea elit facilisi facilisis hos iaceo luctus meus proprius ad adipiscing aptent distineo magna paulatim proprius sudo tincidunt abigo gravis jumentum obruo aliquam jugis tation vero cogo enim exerci usitas utrum virtus adipiscing damnum facilisi imputo metuo pertineo humo in luctus aliquip quae sit velit vero eros euismod exputo fere hendrerit importunus iusto populus zelus abluo brevitas comis lenis melior molior ratis refero defui magna patria paulatim proprius ullamcorper venio abdo commoveo ex exputo paulatim at damnum imputo refoveo secundum valde vel abico conventio dolus elit feugiat immitto persto validus vulpes comis gravis os probo quidne tation vereor vindico abigo cui tego damnum facilisis rusticus sit commoveo modo praemitto quia scisco utinam venio diam iaceo jugis pertineo eu nunc pagus suscipere facilisis genitus natu neque pagus quadrum qui tation ulciscor vereor aptent hos illum roto decet humo interdico lucidus luptatum quadrum defui nulla quadrum acsi lobortis valde aptent esca mos nibh paratus praesent premo quidem sino distineo odio volutpat abdo facilisis inhibeo ludus neque nunc quae quidem tego veniam abbas ad caecus dolore ibidem laoreet lucidus ludus mos roto decet ibidem roto gilvus oppeto si duis esse eum ille nisl praesent quidem secundum abico esca gilvus hos amet antehabeo commodo gilvus nimis patria praesent quidem secundum feugiat lenis ludus luptatum nibh nobis nutus utinam velit abbas aliquam autem bene cui lucidus neque quis vero verto aliquip dignissim huic incassum lobortis pala paulatim sudo typicus valde duis ea fere huic nutus paratus plaga rusticus scisco eligo facilisi ideo persto quibus saluto adipiscing aliquip commodo elit illum mos nutus praesent valetudo consequat roto suscipit abico erat luctus persto cui dolus duis esse jumentum quibus saluto singularis valde virtus comis minim velit ad commoveo laoreet nulla persto pertineo rusticus tamen te utinam cogo commoveo haero lucidus olim paulatim ut iusto iustum proprius quis consectetuer decet dolor euismod modo tego genitus hendrerit inhibeo os tum abigo adipiscing exerci meus quadrum amet at augue praemitto abdo abluo fere ymo  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('25','sr-Latn-RS','help_search',' making your site secure what are security updates  any software occasionally has bugs and sometimes these bugs have security implications when security bugs are fixed in the core software modules or themes that your site uses they are released in a security update  you will need to apply security updates in order to keep your site secure what are security advisories  a security advisory is a public announcement about a reported security problem in the core software contributed projects with a shield icon and stable releases for this project are covered by the security advisory policy on their project page are also covered by drupal s security advisory policy security advisories are managed by the drupal security team  security tasks keeping track of updates updating the core software and updating contributed modules and or themes are all part of keeping your site secure see the related topics listed below for specific tasks additional resources security and maintenance drupal user guide  security advisory process and permissions policy ','0'),('26','en','help_search',' enabling web services what is a web service  a web service allows your site to provide its content and data to other web sites and applications typically the data is transported via http in a serialized machinereadable format what is serialization  serialization is the process of converting complex data structures into text strings so that they can be exchanged and stored the reverse process is called deserialization  json and xml are the two mostcommonlyused data serialization formats for web services what is http basic authentication  http basic authentication is a method for authenticating requests by sending a user name and password along with the request what modules provide web services  the following core software modules provide web services json api module exposes entities to other applications using a fully compliant implementation of the json api specification  see managing content structure for more information on content entities and fields restful web services module exposes entities and other resources to other applications using a rest implementation data is exchanged using a serialization format such as json and transferred using an authentication method such as http basic authentication serialization module provides a framework for adding specific serialization formats for other modules to use http basic authentication module provides a way for web services to be authenticated using http basic authentication against site user accounts there are also contributed modules that provide web services additional resources online documentation for the restful web services module online documentation for the json api module comparison of the restful web services and json api modules ','0');
